{"unit_id":"better-er__dsh-pause#card-zh","repo":"better-er/dsh-pause","commit":"e9e850b26eb16e148c1fa1a434168827b6baa86f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH·暂停（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：在模型完成工具交互、准备发起下一次请求前暂停，方便人类决定何时继续。插件在主机端监听 agent/pre-step，并在 Web composer 工具行加入每会话开关和暂停提示；可按回车或点击按钮放行，也可把文字或图片作为插话随下一步送出。首次请求不会暂停，暂停期间输入框仍可用，关闭开关会放行当前暂停点。适合希望控制 DSH 工具续跑节奏、补充指令的用户。无需 API key 或外部账号，默认关闭，可配置 defaultEnabled。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:267-310","src/client/index.ts:36-62","src/client/PauseBar.tsx:254-357"]}
{"unit_id":"better-er__dsh-pause#card-en","repo":"better-er/dsh-pause","commit":"e9e850b26eb16e148c1fa1a434168827b6baa86f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Pause (DSH plugin, Web client): pause before tool continuations, then resume with Enter or a button. A per-session composer toggle controls the host pause gate; drafted text or images can be sent as an interjection. The first request is never paused. No API key or external account is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:267-310","src/client/index.ts:36-62","src/client/PauseBar.tsx:254-357"]}
